/* --- Four strings the demo video found, 11 Sep 2026 ----------------------
   Every one of these was on screen in English-language footage, in Finnish,
   and scripts/localisation-check.mjs could not see any of them: a ternary's
   literal is not the argument, a String returned from a computed property is
   never looked up, and `searchable(prompt:)` is not one of the initialisers
   the check knows. The call sites were changed so that four of these are now
   shapes it CAN see; "%@-luku", "%lld muistoa" and the one with a duration in
   it stay invisible to it, because it does not check interpolated keys at all.
   "%@-luku" is one key for three call sites — Models, DateSheet and the
   gallery heading all pass the decade as a String rather than an Int, so none
   of them groups the thousands. */
